# TransitBuddy

Hong Kong live transit helper. Product is a few taps and a fast honest answer.

- Never invent live ETAs, hop times, stop names, or fares. Empty operator feed = empty UI. Mark estimates as 估計 / est.
- Default Traditional Chinese. Keep 轉乘助手, 港鐵, 車費, 沿途, 我的回家路線, 使用說明, same-origin `/api`. Recents = popular; 我的回家路線 = bookmarks. Map picks stops.
- Transfer Buddy stays locked on the chosen trip’s live status; never snap to the next bus.
- Local app is port **3001**. Do not commit `.env.local`. After i18n/guide: `npm run sync-i18n`; after guide: `npm run build-manual`.
- Do not block MTR on the KMB directory. Do not wait for a “Show next trains” click to fetch when the 港鐵 tab is open.
